%% Current PoC implemented reference. Native two-hop AgentCore Identity OBO is
%% a separate target and remains gated on non-production validation.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Employee as Employee A
    participant Helper as PowerShell token helper
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant Claude as Claude Code
    participant GW as AgentCore Gateway
    participant Cedar as Direct Cedar policy
    participant Interceptor as OBO assertion interceptor
    participant UserRT as SharePoint delegated Runtime
    participant Graph as Microsoft Graph
    participant SP as SharePoint

    Note over Employee,SP: Current PoC: Gateway CUSTOM_JWT -> IAM/SigV4 -> assertion-copy/MSAL OBO; app-only ingress is gated off.
    Note over Employee,SP: Claude Code is one example; any employee-facing AI app uses this delegated lane when user ACLs must apply.

    Employee->>Helper: Run entra_token_helper.ps1 delegated
    Helper->>Entra: Start device-code flow for Enterprise MCP scope
    Entra-->>Helper: Device code and verification URL
    Helper-->>Employee: Display sign-in instructions
    Employee->>Entra: Complete enterprise sign-in and MFA
    Helper->>Entra: Poll token endpoint with device code
    Entra-->>Helper: Delegated Enterprise MCP JWT
    Helper-->>Employee: Return token into ENTRA_ACCESS_TOKEN
    Employee->>Claude: Start Claude Code with the environment variable
    Note over Employee,Claude: Claude Code does not authenticate the employee
    Claude->>Claude: Read ENTRA_ACCESS_TOKEN
    Claude->>GW: MCP tool call with bearer JWT
    GW->>GW: Validate issuer, audience, expiry, and client
    GW->>Cedar: Authorize sharepoint-delegated___sharepoint_upload_file
    Cedar-->>GW: Allow or deny
    alt Cedar allows
        GW->>Interceptor: Validated bearer and sharepoint-delegated action
        Interceptor-->>GW: x-mcp-user-assertion
        GW->>UserRT: SigV4 invoke with assertion header
        UserRT->>UserRT: Reject invalid upload arguments
        UserRT->>Entra: OBO exchange for Microsoft Graph
        Entra-->>UserRT: Delegated Graph access token
        UserRT->>Graph: Call Graph as employee
        Graph->>SP: Evaluate native employee permissions
        SP-->>Graph: Site A allowed, B/C/D denied
        Graph-->>UserRT: Result or access denied
        UserRT-->>GW: MCP result
        GW-->>Claude: MCP response
        Claude-->>Employee: Show result
    else Cedar denies
        GW-->>Claude: 403, Runtime is not invoked
        Claude-->>Employee: Show authorization failure
    end
